                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Horse, bow, thrusting spear, light armour and shield. Open Order and Expert Horsemen with Feigned Flight and Parthian Shot. (Armies of Chivalry p.51)</characteristic>
