              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Halberd and heavy armour. May wear partial plate armour (+2 pts) and carry a shield (+1 pt). Veteran. May be in Mixed Order with Crossbowmen or Handgunners. (Armies of Chivalry p.51)</characteristic>
