            <profile id="0bc3-3944-e809-2c68" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The cost of the war wagon includes six crewmen: three armed with halberds and three with crossbow or handgun, all with light armour. A team of 2-4 horses. War wagons may be single models (no Leader, Standard Bearer or Musician) or grouped in units of at least three models. One wagon per unit may include a tarasnices (palisade gun) for +20 pts (not built). May have one War Wagon per 1,000 army points (bought from the Infantry allocation). (Armies of Chivalry p.51)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
