  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="6340-bf37-2c14-97fc" name="Kingdom of Hungary (Armies of Chivalry) - List Notes" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false">
      <description>THE KINGDOM OF HUNGARY 1307-1526 (Armies of Chivalry, pp.50-51). Allies (Moldavian/Wallachian, Polish, Hundred Years War French) are documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[The Kingdom of Hungary]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 50%, at least 25%
  Infantry: up to 50%, at least 25%
  Characters 0-25%, Cavalry 25-50%, Infantry 25-50%. Artillery and War Wagons are bought from the Infantry allocation. Allies 0-25%: may have Moldavian/Wallachian, Polish, or Hundred Years War French allies (documented only); Moldavians/Wallachians are subject to the Allies &amp; Mercenaries rule.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
